{"ref":"BDB, עֵ֫רֶב","hw":"עֵ֫רֶב","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֵ֫רֶב</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12\" href=\"/Exodus.12\">Ex 12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38\" href=\"/Exodus.38\">38</a> <strong>mixture, mixed company</strong>;—heterogeneous body attached to a people; to Israel <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:38\" href=\"/Exodus.12.38\">Ex 12:38</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.3\">Ne 13:3</a>; to Egyptians <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.20\">Je 25:20</a> (𝔙 joins to v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.19\">19</a>, so Gie); to Chaldeans <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:37\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.37\">50:37</a>; in <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.24\">Je 25:24</a> del. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְאֵת</span> … <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעֶרֶב</span> as doublet (so Gie, cf. 𝔊); in <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:15\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.15\">1 K 10:15</a> read <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲרָב</span> (as ‖ <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 9:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.9.14\">2 Ch 9:14</a>, so Benz Kit al.); <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 30:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.30.5\">Ez 30:5</a> read prob. id. (Co).","next":"BDB, עֵ֫רֶב²","prev":"BDB, ערב"}